      "id": "uQwWM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≡</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>Br</mi></math>",
